## 1. Background

This document provides R and Nimble code to implement multi-event capture-recapture analysis to estimate survival of *Gyps* vultures (African white-backed and Ruppells) in eastern Africa. The code is linked to the following manuscript:

B. W. Rolek, L. Dunn, C. J. Kendall, C. J. W. McClure, S. Thomsett, D. Muteti, M. Z. Virani, E. R. Buechley, R. Buij. 2026. Survival of *Gyps* vultures remains low during periods of human-wildlife conflict and management in eastern Africa. Biological Conservation.

